WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.530
- So it takes 2,700 people

00:00:02.530 --> 00:00:06.250
to put on the Oscars and every
job is equally important.

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:09.221
Okay, the gaffers, the camera people,

00:00:09.221 --> 00:00:11.730
the seat fillers, everybody, all right?

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:13.570
And oh, so what the seat fillers do,

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:15.335
I hear you, seat fillers.

00:00:15.335 --> 00:00:17.930
I'll just explain what you do.

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:20.020
So when you get up to go to the bathroom

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:22.813
or if you're go going to
cry 'cause you didn't win.

00:00:24.053 --> 00:00:26.070
Oh my God.

00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:26.903
Actually, you know what?

00:00:26.903 --> 00:00:28.360
Let me just show you
what the seat fillers do.

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:29.750
Okay. Here's a seat filler.

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:31.110
Can we get you up, honey?

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:32.820
You wanna go to the bathroom?

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:34.104
Okay.

00:00:34.104 --> 00:00:34.937
- What?

00:00:34.937 --> 00:00:35.770
- Let's just get you, thank you.

00:00:35.770 --> 00:00:36.890
Seat fillers, love them.

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:40.337
Jesse, I loved you in "Power of the Dog."

00:00:41.534 --> 00:00:43.950
- You know that, that was my wife.

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:45.800
- You're married to that seat filler?

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:49.583
Oh, that's weird.

